        "return": "0x00000000"
      }
    }
  ],
  "assertions": [
    "The length register receives (count-1) modulo 2^32; count zero stores 0xFFFFFFFF.",
    "Each byte iteration waits for ready, reads a 32-bit data-register word, stores its low byte to [R1], and increments R1 by one.",
    "The byte-ready wait checks bit 1 of controller+0x28 before each data-register read and output-byte store.",
    "Completion uses repeated 32-bit reads of controller+0x20; a nonzero value prevents return.",
    "The returned R0 is the final zero status word, not the initial mode selector."
  ]
}
